{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/boulevard-heights-emaar-downtown-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":630,"crm_id":"1621","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Boulevard Heights","slug":"boulevard-heights-emaar-downtown-dubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":3751888,"display_price":"3.7M","lattitude":25.1929371,"longitude":55.2680751,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Boulevard Heights is an ultra luxurious project by developer Emaar, located in the centre of hustle and bustle and luxury - Downtown Dubai. It combines contemporary design, luxury and amenities to create the ultimate living space.</p><p>The development consists of two towers of 53 and 46 storeys, featuring premium <strong>1-4 bedroom apartments</strong>. The facades and interiors of the buildings are designed in a contemporary style using the highest quality materials, while the panoramic windows of each residence offer mesmerising views of the metropolis, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Fountain.</p><p>Residents of Boulevard Heights can enjoy luxurious amenities including a swimming pool, gym, gardens, playgrounds and numerous recreational areas. In addition, with its convenient location in the heart of Downtown Dubai, residents have easy access to restaurants, cafes, shops, shopping centres and other entertainment and cultural facilities.</p><p>The location of the development provides easy accessibility to major attractions and other areas of Dubai. Dubai Mall is just 5 minutes away and Dubai Canal is 10 minutes away. La Mer Beach can be reached in 19 minutes and Dubai Marina and Marina Mall are within a 20-minute drive.</p><p>Boulevard Heights is not just a place to live, it is a lifestyle where luxury and comfort are combined with the conveniences of a modern urban lifestyle.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1621/images/2024/04/15/4qfop4Ow1fgrKqoUSCahU6kY86JYn1UUszYLR1BU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/4qfop4Ow1fgrKqoUSCahU6kY86JYn1UUszYLR1BU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1621/images/2024/04/15/DkFGH3agsoJQJIyp5zL9jhWu4MimUjPBzS2X8trC.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/DkFGH3agsoJQJIyp5zL9jhWu4MimUjPBzS2X8trC.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1621/images/2024/04/15/YFZHJ1EbDdIx53NPNXIMzdp9xXACSBpDTJv3F9u6.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/YFZHJ1EbDdIx53NPNXIMzdp9xXACSBpDTJv3F9u6.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2767,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/04/15/ZNwlZYAmn0M9nehcrloUkxnw8jBnYqRlA6RZ4ASY.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6458,"title":"20%","description":"On booking"},{"id":6459,"title":"80%","description":"On handover"}],"community":"Downtown Dubai","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11027,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11028,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11029,"url":null,"text":"Dining outlets  (coffee houses & restaurants)","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11030,"url":null,"text":"BBQ","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11031,"url":null,"text":"Infinity pool","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":443,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Boulevard Heights","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Boulevard Heights","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Do